Cell["\<\
A cycle whose vertices have constant distance sum from antipodal foci. The \
separating condition is omitted because the level surface fills this \
substrate.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"278f1299-3030-44f4-a1bb-bc1a58c14100"],

